 ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3252220/extras/9615b57b21d0cee224f9d44d822404fa.poster.avif?t=1786072467\" width=1170 height=658 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3252220/extras/9615b57b21d0cee224f9d44d822404fa.webm?t=1786072467\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3252220/extras/9615b57b21d0cee224f9d44d822404fa.mp4?t=1786072467\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p>", "short_description": "As investigator Arjun Miller, delve into the depths of the abandoned Anya Manon Hospital, a place with a dark and twisted past. Uncover its sinister secrets while fighting for survival against horrifying creatures and solving puzzles. Experience horror, gripping suspense, and a chilling atmosphere.", "supported_languages": "English<strong>*</strong><br><strong>*</strong>languages with full audio support", "header_image": "https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3252220/daf5aaab52db6dc38e8d273b546e61b1aff022f7/header.jpg?t=1786072467", "capsule_image": "https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3252220/022a4bf9bd399323200d09eefaa53ed0bdaa5781/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1786072467", "capsule_imagev5": "https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3252220/022a4bf9bd399323200d09eefaa53ed0bdaa5781/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1786072467", "website": null, "pc_requirements": {"minimum": "<strong>Minimum:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><strong>OS:</strong> WIN 10<br></li><li><strong>Processor:</strong> Intel i5-760 (4*2800), AMD Phenom II<br></li><li><strong>Graphics:</strong> Nvidia GeForce GTX 650 / Radeon HD 7510<br></li><li><strong>DirectX:</strong> Version 11<br></li><li><strong>Network:</strong> Broadband Internet connection<br></li><